回望</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://yixiuer.me/poetry/retrospection/"/><id>https://yixiuer.me/poetry/retrospection/</id><updated>2024-10-27T02:08:16+08:00</updated><published>2024-09-08T17:09:00+09:00</published><author><name>一休兒</name><uri>https://yixiuer.me/</uri><email>yixiuer.me@gmail.com</email></author><rights>在保留本文作者及本文鏈接的前提下，非商業用途隨意轉載分享。</rights><summary type="html">
&lt;p>你應該這麼做&lt;br>
他沉著平靜說道&lt;/p>
&lt;p>我望著他&lt;br>
又看著沉浮不定&lt;/p>
&lt;p>你的狀態很好&lt;br>
我回望對他說道&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://reuixiy.notion.site/0f2f053d96b84454a1706f9c3f1e13ec">*&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>閱讀全文：&lt;a href="https://yixiuer.me/poetry/retrospection/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://yixiuer.me/poetry/retrospection/&lt;/a>&lt;br>
