煙火龍鳴</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://yixiuer.me/poetry/fireworks-roaring/"/><id>https://yixiuer.me/poetry/fireworks-roaring/</id><updated>2024-10-27T02:08:16+08:00</updated><published>2024-02-10T01:35:54+09:00</published><author><name>一休兒</name><uri>https://yixiuer.me/</uri><email>yixiuer.me@gmail.com</email></author><rights>在保留本文作者及本文鏈接的前提下，非商業用途隨意轉載分享。</rights><summary type="html">
&lt;p>火花即興飛舞&lt;br>
似錦瑟無端音絃&lt;br>
轉瞬即逝&lt;/p>
&lt;p>花火熱烈綻放&lt;br>
似宇宙漫天繁星&lt;br>
隨風煙寂&lt;/p>
&lt;p>星河扶光流落&lt;br>
恰山水一聲驚鳴&lt;br>
響亮永恆&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
