鵲橋</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://yixiuer.me/poetry/magpie-bridge/"/><id>https://yixiuer.me/poetry/magpie-bridge/</id><updated>2024-10-27T02:08:16+08:00</updated><published>2023-12-20T02:07:23+09:00</published><author><name>一休兒</name><uri>https://yixiuer.me/</uri><email>yixiuer.me@gmail.com</email></author><rights>在保留本文作者及本文鏈接的前提下，非商業用途隨意轉載分享。</rights><summary type="html">
&lt;p>快看！那是一顆超新星！&lt;br>
遙手一請&lt;br>
綻放出一束璀璨的瑰麗&lt;/p>
&lt;p>每當指尖觸及&lt;br>
自己就從室內&lt;br>
橫跨為&lt;br>
被滿天星斗環繞的自我&lt;br>
相擁在橫跨銀河的鵲橋&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>閱讀全文：&lt;a href="https://yixiuer.me/poetry/magpie-bridge/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://yixiuer.me/poetry/magpie-bridge/&lt;/a>&lt;br>
